"""Conversion: BAC 2016 – اللّغة العربيّة وآدابها – شعبة آداب وفلسفة – الموضوع الأوّل (محمّد الشّبّوكي، قصيدة معركة الجرف).
2016 had one ordinary session (header: «دورة: 2016»).
Exam (most faithful source): gdrive 1Fopc1iYl4g7aay6OGMi0UkIOcrFO1mZ9 (بكالوريا العربية 2016  شعبة اداب وفلسفة.docx);
same paper as PDF (owner's copy): gdrive 1fc1qtkvCmZVndXsjHayQ7yewo6GeSTjK (BAC 2016 - اللغة العربية - آداب وفلسفة.pdf);
official ONEC paper: gdrive 1q0mIwX1r7ODpcB5gPws9CbCAMgPua_VH (01_الموضوع.pdf, pages 1–2 — used to check the docx);
official mark scheme (ONEC «الإجابة النّموذجيّة»): gdrive 1tujJiPLIxR87ordP9koFDgInty2VFVVn (02_التصحيح.pdf, pages 1–3).

Method (same as the BAC 2017–2023 converters): the verbatim strings below (introduction, poem, reference, glossary,
question texts) were generated from the .docx with python-docx (runs read exactly, tatweel kept; only outer whitespace
and edge direction marks trimmed) and re-checked programmatically against it; the docx was compared with the official
ONEC paper (same verses and questions; underlined «غنّى» and «مهشّمة» in both). The docx has several diacritic slips
against the ONEC paper (e.g. «أذكّر» for «أذكُر», «وردّت» for «وردَتْ», «القَيّم / القيّم» for «القِيَم») — kept as in
the docx (diacritics only, as in the earlier converters); owner to decide. The correction PDF's text layer is reversed
presentation-form Arabic, so the mark scheme was read from the rendered pages (150 dpi, fully legible). Every mark comes
from the official scheme; correct options and explanations condense its wording.

Conversion notes / points for the owner's review:
- Streams: header of the paper and of the correction: «آداب وفلسفة» ⇒ LIT.
- The poem table of the docx stores each verse as [عجز, empty, «n-صدر»] ⇒ rows written [n-, صدر, عجز].
- «n×m» rule used in the 2016 converters: distinct required parts ⇒ one element per part; a list of interchangeable
  items (any k of those listed) ⇒ one element; the main ideas of a plan stay one element (as in the 2021 converters).
- Q1 «2×0.5» = the cause + its clarification (verses 2–3). Q2 «2×0.5» beside the list of grievances: read as the
  question's two demands — the grievances (0.5, «منها:» four listed) and the opinion (0.5, «يُقبل رأي التّلميذ إذا كان
  معلّلًا» ⇒ deferred essay_builder, guide rule 11). Q3 0.5 (conviction + where it led; «لا يُنقّط الاستدلال من النّصّ»).
  Q4 0.5. Q5: 0.5 general idea + «4×0.5» main ideas with verse ranges (one element, matching + ordering).
- Q6 (تلخيص) «1/1/1» = ملاءمة المضمون / مراعاة حجم النّصّ / أسلوب المترشّح ⇒ three deferred essay_builder elements.
- Q7: 0.5 the type (الوصفيّ) + «2×0.5» two indicators among six. «السّرديّ / الحجاجيّ» are not used as distractors.
- Part 2: Q1 0.5; Q2 «2×0.25» = referent + role; Q3 «4×0.25» = one per plural (أوقات، مجانين، معارك، قوم: class +
  justification); Q4 0.5 per word / sentence (no «نعت» distractor for (شينا): «ما» may be read as نكرة موصوفة);
  Q5 «2×0.25» = type + purpose («يُراعى في إجابة المترشّح صحّة المعنى» ⇒ distractors only foreign purposes);
  Q6 per image «3×0.25» = الشّرح / النّوع / سرّ البلاغة.
- Part 3 (04): «01» introduction (the revolution's appeal to poets thanks to its values), «01» the main values (five listed),
  «01» the evidence («ومن الشّواهد المدروسة: (للاستئناس)»), «01» the candidate's style («يُراعى… ذكر أهمّ القيم، وصحّة
  الشّواهد، والأسلوب السّليم») ⇒ the values are interactive; introduction, evidence and style are deferred essay_builder.
- Deferred: Q2 opinion 0.5 + summary 3 + part 3 (introduction 1, evidence 1, style 1) = 6.5 points.
"""
